{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41359","headline":"句 · 冯道","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝披四袄专藏手，夜覆三衾怕露头。\n牛头偏得赐，象笏更容持。\n已落地花方遣埽，未经霜草莫教锄。\n视草北来唐学士，拥旄西去汉将军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}